WEBVTT

00:14:29.499 --> 00:14:31.801
A quarter of us like nudgers.

00:14:32.101 --> 00:14:33.269
"I love you, John,

00:14:33.302 --> 00:14:36.105
but maybe you should try this,
maybe you should do that."

00:14:36.506 --> 00:14:39.041
But one in six of us like slappers.

00:14:39.041 --> 00:14:42.145
"I love you, Anna, but get over yourself,
it's time to do this."

00:14:42.178 --> 00:14:43.479
(Laughter)

00:14:43.513 --> 00:14:45.548
The key point is,

00:14:45.581 --> 00:14:50.019
don't assume that the other person likes
the same type of response.

00:14:50.019 --> 00:14:52.021
Ask before you advise.

00:14:53.756 --> 00:14:56.492
And that leads to tip number five.

00:14:57.493 --> 00:14:59.395
Rewrite your life story.